      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Somehow, the ultra-rich keep getting ultra-richer, while a growing percentage of people feel truly desperate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2047876753062756796",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T03:14:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What\u2019s the status of the War with Iran?  We\u2019re seizing their boats, they\u2019re seizing our boats. It\u2019s less like a Holy War and more like a Florida divorce.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2047876569381929184",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-25T03:13:16+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Israel has seven democratic allies left in the Senate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2046348939520266726",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-20T22:03:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Happy 420 From @ClubRandom_ &amp; @theWOODSWeHo!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2046234656677515740",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-20T14:28:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I thought about doing this without any jokes, something I've never done here in 23 years, to impress upon people how much different I feel this issue is from any I have ever covered.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2045337329746022895",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T03:03:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "bill-maher",
      "voiceName": "Bill Maher",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Israel and Lebanon have agreed to a 10-day ceasefire! Hezbollah could tell something was going on because their pagers were blowing up.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/billmaher/status/2045337128272642145",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T03:02:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
